WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:02.930
Hey, Rin Rin, don't go too far ahead by yourself.  I'm not gonna look for you, if you get lost.

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:07.500
By the way, what about your lost friend?

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:09.410
If I remember right, her name was...

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:10.440
It's Chōun.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:15.390
Yes, that’s it.  It is worrisome you haven’t met up with her yet.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.460
She’s not a kid.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.360
I’m sure she’s doing just fine somewhere under the blue sky.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.410
Eh, another fork in the road.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.010
Which way should we go?

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.440
Let me see.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.700
I’ll take care of it again!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:46.690
This way!

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:49.850
Then we take that one.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:51.420
Hey, what’s up with that?

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.810
Isn’t obvious?

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.800
Last time we let your fortune-telling pick our path…

00:02:55.870 --> 00:03:01.220
We got lost in the fog and I fell off a steep slope and hurt myself.  It was a total disaster.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.720
That’s…

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.740
But the fortune-telling says that way.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:10.610
All I’m saying is your fortune-telling can’t be trusted.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:22.990
Kan'u, I agree that there is no logic behind Rin Rin’s fortune-telling.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:28.340
But following it won’t necessarily lead to a disaster.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:32.440
I think we should take the path Rin Rin suggests.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.300
If you say so.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.760
Then…

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.810
Stop meddling in other peoples’ business.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:44.440
This is something between me and Aisha!  It’s none of your business, so butt out!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:50.700
Rin Rin, what are you saying?  Koumei was just trying to help you out.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.540
Nobody asked her!

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.360
Rin Rin.  Hey, Rin Rin wait!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.810
Anyways, I’m going the way my fortune-telling points.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:01.790
Do as you wish!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.040
I will!

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:09.200
Rin Rin!  Is it alright to let her go by herself?

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:12.850
Don’t mind her.  Sooner or later she’ll get lonely and say...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.980
“I‘m going to go with you guys, after all.”

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.270
She will come back.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:19.320
But…

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.990
Come on Koumei, let’s go.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:32.910
<b>Chohi has a Fight with Kan'u</b>

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:36.040
<i>Aisha always takes Koumei’s side.</i>

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:46.190
It’s a city!  My prediction was right on the money!

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.320
Serves her right!

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.190
I’m hungry.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:06.880
But Aisha has the wallet, so I can’t buy anything to eat.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.080
What does it say?

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.470
Even though there aren’t too many hard words, I still can’t read it.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:25.520
“The Big Eating Tournament is being held today.  Open to all participants.  The winner will receive cash and prizes”

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:26.670
Bachō!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.580
Hey, long time no see!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:33.590
Why are you here?  Didn’t you go back to your hometown, Seiryou?

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:40.300
I already did.  I took care of all my affairs and set out for training again.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.700
But I ran out of money when I got here.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:45.580
Then does that mean you’re going to…

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.210
That’s right!

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.100
I’m going to win that competition and claim the prize money!

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:51.670
Not so fast!

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.650
I’m the one who’s going to win that prize money.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:58.070
You can try.  You’re a worthy opponent!

00:05:58.240 --> 00:05:59.560
This is going to be a war, Chōhi!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.060
Bring it on!

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.490
<b>Big Stomach Tournament</b>

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:12.320
The Annual Big Eating Tournament is finally coming to a close.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:16.460
Let me introduce the three “eating warrior” finalists.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:20.980
First contestant is Bachō, who hails from Seiryou.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.430
Followed by Chōhi, her tiger hairpin is not just for show!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:29.150
Her eating is feared even by tigers!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:32.000
Roar!  Roar!

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:38.430
And finally Kyocho, whose amazing appetite does not match her tiny body!

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.830
She’s tiny.  She’s tiny.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:42.400
Don’t call me tiny!

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:47.200
In the final match, each contestant will eat red bean paste buns, which taste so-so.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:52.760
We will see how many they can eat within the time limit.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:57.280
If everyone’s ready, let’s start!

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.270
As expected from the “eating warriors” who fought their way to the final.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:17.590
They are swallowing these so-so tasting buns without any trouble.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.190
<i>Kyocho’s  gobbling them down like nothing!</i>

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:29.650
<i>She ate the most in the previous matches, where does she put it all?</i>

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.810
<i>I’m not going to lose!</i>

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:38.100
<i>Damn it, I’ll be left behind by those two at this rate!</i>

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:42.730
<i>This is bad… I’m already reaching my limit!</i>

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:51.110
<i>Everything I ate during this competition is passing in front of my eyes like a revolving door!</i>

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:54.550
<i>Is this the end for me?  Is this where I fall?</i>

00:07:55.000 --> 00:08:03.030
<i>But, even if!  Even if I were to die in the gutter, I have to fall forward!</i>

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:09.780
Bachō’s out cold!  Now it’s just me against her!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:17.910
She stopped leaving 3 buns.  I can still beat her if I pick up my pace.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.540
If…

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.840
If I eat these, I’ll beat her.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.590
No Way!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:36.830
Seconds please!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.020
I lost!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.540
I didn’t get the prize money.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:54.980
We can call it a day since we stuffed ourselves.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:09:00.820
By the way, what happened to Kan'u and Chōun?  Are they working at some store again?

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.300
Actually…

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:08.440
What?  You lost Chōun and had a fight with Kan'u, and split up?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:13.090
It wasn’t my fault!  Aisha was being mean.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:15.670
Hey!

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.040
You are the girl from the competition.

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.590
My name is Kyocho Chūkō.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.020
I am traveling around the country to train as a competitive eater.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.250
My name is Chōhi Yokutoku.

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:31.980
My name is Bachō Mōki.  I am from Seiryou.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:37.680
You two did quite well.  You are the first ones who actually gave me a run for my money.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.820
This is my first time seeing someone with a bottomless stomach!

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.940
Ah, you are flattering me.   I’m not that good.

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.540
That was not a compliment.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.140
Oh, really?  Well, whatever.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:52.840
It must have been some kind of fate that brought us together like this.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:55.970
Why don’t we get to know each other better over something yummy to eat?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.270
Eh, you still have room to eat?

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.970
Your stomach is really bottomless!

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:06.190
You don’t have to worry about the money.  I am going to treat you with the prize money.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.790
Well, the problem is not the money.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:08.940
What are you talking about?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.830
We should have already paid back all the money we borrowed.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.830
Kid, debt comes with interest.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.790
Look, as written in the contract.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.100
Give it to me!

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:25.420
That was close.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:28.160
Hey, make him hurt.

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.380
Hold it right there!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.350
Who are you guys?

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.890
We are traveling competitive eaters.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.360
Nah, that’s just you.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.850
I don’t care what kind of eater you are.  You’ll get hurt if you butt in.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.800
That’s right.  Now get lost, shorties!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.780
Who you’re calling shorties?

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:52.610
Who?  You, you…  And this one.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.700
You don’t have to include me, you dim wit!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.960
What a bunch of morons!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.140
Shut up, shorty!

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.350
Shorty…

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:04.150
You said “shorty” again…

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.620
So, what if I did?

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:08.780
I’m going to crush you!

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.710
Where the heck did she pull that from?!

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.810
Monster!

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:31.200
Don’t let the door hit you on your way out.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.990
You’re supposed to say, don’t let the door hit you where Buddha splits you.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:41.360
Those guys are real con artists.  We did pay back what we borrowed.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:45.250
They made this contract without our knowledge and said there’s still interest left.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:49.560
They also said if we can’t pay the interest, they’ll take my sister as collateral.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:50.750
What a cruel thing to do!

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:54.710
Damn, if I knew that, I would’ve crushed them for sure!

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.170
Indeed.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.050
Sis, I’m home!

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:28.260
Welcome back.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.290
Who are these people?

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:36.160
So that’s what happened.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:41.580
Thank you for saving my brother from danger.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.640
Sis, they are in the middle of a journey.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:49.790
Since they haven’t found an inn yet, we should let them stay here as our thanks.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.090
That sounds great, please stay with us tonight.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.070
We accept your invitation.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.120
In that case, please accept this as payment.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.320
Please, I can’t do that.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:04.770
Eh, Why not?  With that, we can repay the interest no matter how much it is.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:12.110
What are you saying?  We’re asking these people to stay in appreciation for saving you.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:16.460
If we take their money, our invitation is meaningless.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.790
Besides, if you hadn't committed such a thoughtless act in the first place…

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.800
What’s wrong, Chōhi?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.380
It’s nothing, nothing.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.860
Kan'u.   Kan'u!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:45.070
What is it, Koumei?

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:47.090
What are you thinking about?

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.830
Oh, nothing important.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:53.280
You’re lying.  You were thinking about Rin Rin, weren’t you?

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:58.390
Kan'u, let’s go back right now.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.700
If we walk all night, we might catch up with her somewhere.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.300
Don’t be ridiculous!

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:05.970
But we can’t leave her like that.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.760
Koumei, it’s already late.  We should try to get some sleep.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.910
Kan'u.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.200
Is this enough?

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.420
Thank you for your hard work.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:51.380
I am really sorry to make you help me with the chores.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:55.380
Well, I wouldn’t feel right to just eat and not contribute.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.280
Oh my.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.790
Sis, I’m back.

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:01.360
Oh wow, so much food.

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:05.320
Sis, she’s amazing!  This was her first visit to the mountain.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.940
But she kept finding mushrooms and edible plants left and right.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:13.290
Securing food in the mountains is one of the basic training for a competitive eater.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.750
That’s what she calls it?

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.120
By the way, where is Chōhi?

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:20.270
Weren’t you guys together?

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:23.370
Eh, I thought she was with you.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.790
What are you guys doing here?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.160
I thought you would be here.

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.870
Thanks for everything you did yesterday.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:43.360
You’re here for another beating?  I am letting you know, I won’t hold back this time.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:48.820
Wait, we’re not your opponent today.  Master, please.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.400
What?  I took the job as your bodyguard for peanuts…

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:01.290
Because you told me, you were beat up by some strong fighters.   These are just kids.

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.560
Who are you calling “kids”?

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:07.390
Beside Chōhi, I am not a kid!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.250
Wait a second, what do you mean by that?

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.750
Hey, this is not the time to fight among us.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.370
You guys are funny.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.490
Hey big guy, hold this for me.  There’s still some sake left in it, so don’t drop the jug.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:24.740
Yes, ma’am.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.140
My name is Chouryou.

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:36.320
Until yesterday I was a traveling martial artist.   Today I am a paid body guard.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:41.850
I don’t have anything against you guys but this is my job.  I hope you like pain.

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:45.290
You are the one who’s going to feel pain!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:48.800
That’s the spirit.  I like your attitude otherwise it won’t be fun.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.980
It’s bothersome to attack you individually. Come at me all at once.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.580
Where did you pull that from?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.520
You didn’t let me finish my comeback.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:36.050
Not bad, not bad at all for a bunch of kids, you have some skills.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:42.380
<i>Although I took this job for the booze money, I haven’t felt this excited in a long time.</i>

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:44.640
Damn, she’s strong!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.350
Even though it’s three of us against her.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.780
She’s enjoying this fight.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.820
The fight’s over.

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:58.480
Lousy cheats!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:03.140
Throw down your weapons or the kid gets it.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.920
Wait a sec.  What do you think you’re doing?

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.630
What do you mean?

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:12.600
You spoiled our fight just as it was getting interesting.
That’s what I mean by “what do you think you’re doing”?

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.270
Well…

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:19.310
Master, sorry about that, but we have our own way of doing things.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.390
So hurry up and drop your weapons.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.250
Ouch!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.630
Who are you?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.020
Show your face!

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:43.370
In order to amend these chaotic times, a single butterfly flutters down to the earth.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.960
The messenger of justice and beauty, Butterfly Mask at your service!

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:49.460
Butterfly…

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.920
Mask…  Oh boy.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.370
Rin Rin, Bachō, it’s been a while.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.300
Is she a friend of yours?

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:01.940
Well, umm… how can I explain this?

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.020
I don’t know a weirdo like that.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:07.810
Hey!  I don’t know where you learned my name.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:12.580
But it bothers me to have people think I know a weirdo like you!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:17.200
She’s mad...  She’s clearly mad...

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:21.170
Hey, I don’t care if you are a butterfly or a goose, just come down!

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:25.860
That’s fine with me but I don’t think you will like it very much.  Is that alright?

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:37.580
Taking hostages, playing dirty, thanks for spoiling my fun.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.770
I’m going to squash you for sure this time!

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:41.000
Bro!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.970
Why did you get in my way?

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:51.560
I was hired by their money and I’m still their bodyguard.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:53.820
I will take care of their misconduct.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.370
Hey, show me the contract.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.210
Okay.

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:03.800
Hold it tight.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:16.000
Listen.  Don’t ever go near those siblings again, you got it?

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:17.500
Yes, ma’am!

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:18.990
Then scram!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.280
Excuse us!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.190
Geez!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:23.930
All’s well that ends well.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:30.050
Guess I am leaving too.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.630
What are you going to do now?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:39.580
Like a wandering warrior, I’ll follow the wind and my whim.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:42.040
What a strange person.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:45.690
Speaking of strange, that weird masked person…

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:47.750
She is gone...

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:51.750
She was shady from the start to the end.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.220
<i>She really didn’t recognise who she was.</i>

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:02.520
I thought it was cool.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.670
Thank you so very much.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:09.130
Goodbye.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.110
Take care.

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:15.040
By the way, Kyocho, where are you heading now?

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:21.090
I’m going to Rakuyou for the time being.  I’m sure it will have bigger and better eating tournaments.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:26.900
Well then, we will be parting ways ahead.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:33.500
If it’s alright with you, would you like to come with me?  If you are going to travel alone...

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.470
Chōhi, I take back what I said.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:38.400
Huh?

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:39.730
Look.

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:47.480
Aisha!

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:53.200
Aisha!  Aisha!  Aisha!

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.100
What has come over you all of a sudden?

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:59.100
How come you’re here?  Why?

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:03.760
We turned back yesterday morning and reached the city before evening.

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:08.070
We looked everywhere in the town for you but we couldn’t find you.

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:14.500
Then, Koumei suggested waiting by the roads near the city exits…  So, we might be able to meet with you.

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:16.620
Where is Koumei?

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:23.230
She said perhaps you might go back the way you came.  So she’s waiting for you at the opposite exit.

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:29.140
Aisha… Why did you come back?

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:33.140
Why?  Obviously, I came back to look for you.

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:36.650
I mean why did you come looking for me?

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:40.230
Why didn’t you just go ahead with Koumei?

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:47.220
Umm... Well...  How should I put this…?

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:49.580
Ah, this is annoying!

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:53.530
Get this in your head Rin Rin!  I’m the older sister and you’re the younger one.

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:56.470
That’s why we have to be together no matter where we go.  Got it?

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:58.800
Okay!

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:06.130
Who’s that black hair lady?  Is she a friend of Chōhi’s?

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:13.090
Although not related by blood, they are really close to each other.

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:14.370
I see.

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:19.030
Hey, let me go!

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:35.900
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:41.080
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.920
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:47.750 --> 00:23:51.340
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:56.660
<i>I run away when times are tough,
but get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:56.730 --> 00:24:01.700
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:06.910
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:14.350
<i>I am so brave that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:14.630 --> 00:24:19.640
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:19.780 --> 00:24:24.720
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:24.960 --> 00:24:29.790
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:30.040 --> 00:24:35.110
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:44.850 --> 00:24:49.090
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
